  "description": "Meet the Cyrusher Flex — a slim-tire, step-over commuter e-bike designed for riders who want speed, comfort, and everyday practicality. With responsive dual-sensor assist, efficient 27.5” tires, and a powerful 750W motor, the Flex makes commuting and leisure riding effortless.\n\nSporty Step-Over Frame\nA sleek, stable frame geometry built for confidence and control, perfect for riders who prefer a classic athletic feel.\n\nSlim 27.5” Tires for Efficiency\nFast-rolling tires cut down drag, giving you smoother handling on pavement and bike paths.\n\nDual Sensor Modes: Torque + Cadence\nSwitch between natural, responsive torque sensing or steady cadence mode—adaptable to your ride style.\n\nPower + Range\nA 750W hub motor paired with a 48V 15Ah LG battery delivers reliable acceleration and up to 59 miles of range.\n\nComfort & Control\nDual suspension, upright riding posture, and ergonomic design keep rides smooth and fatigue-free.\n\nBuilt for Real Life\nHydraulic disc brakes, integrated lighting, and reflective slim tires ensure confidence across all conditions.\n\nWhy You’ll Love the Flex:\nIt’s quick, comfortable, and efficient—perfect for commuting, fitness rides, or simply enjoying the open road.",
